d draw them as you like.\nAny poses or expressions are up to you!\nPlease appeal again for the correct amount if needed!\nThank you very much~\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/FSFQ5tE\nhttps://imgur.com/a/CJXXrYX", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mizco01/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9a5c9752/uploads/origins/808db661-1677-4afc-b54d-41f660f423a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddd04d91273c29066c74661d003e8e67", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9a5c9752/uploads/origins/808db661-1677-4afc-b54d-41f660f423a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ddd04d91273c29066c74661d003e8e67, https://si.imgix.net/9a5c9752/uploads/origins/808db661-1677-4afc-b54d-41f660f423a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7824fa02da2536ec23f30a71321a34a1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9a5c9752/uploads/origins/808db661-1677-4afc-b54d-41f660f423a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75437e056c1d84f2b681c2a9f824e144 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello,\n\nThank you for your appeal. I like your soft style! Please draw my young Chloe? Please see the reference for the character. She is a 6 year old girl. For the clothing, use the red set I have included on the bottom of the reference. Her personality is cheerful, elegant, fun.\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/891296543485853748/1170334073319858237/image.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mizco01/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9044a1da/uploads/origins/6e67069c-5e2d-4644-ada9-b74bdfad6598?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4cfcdff76b1afd1fcffa153b978417e5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9044a1da/uploads/origins/6e67069c-5e2d-4644-ada9-b74bdfad6598?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4cfcdff76b1afd1fcffa1